Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:05.071
u

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:07.073 size:53% position:73% line:53%
important à Longueuil tout comme

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:09.142 size:53% position:73% line:53%
